    {
      "id": 65151,
      "title": "Mayor and Council Meeting",
      "url": "https://www.rockvillemd.gov/calendar/meetings/mayor-and-council-meeting-no-26-26",
      "start_date": "2026-10-26 18:30:00",
      "end_date": "2026-10-26 22:30:00",
      "all_day": false,
      "description": "<p>The <a href=\"https://www.rockvillemd.gov/government/mayor-and-council/\">Mayor and Council</a> hold meetings on most Mondays. Meetings are held in the Mayor and Council chambers on the third floor of Rockville City Hall.</p>\n<p>Meetings are broadcast live on Rockville 11 (channel 11 on county cable systems), livestreamed at <a href=\"https://www.rockvillemd.gov/rockville11\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">rockvillemd.gov/rockville11</a>, and are available a day after each meeting at <a href=\"https://www.rockvillemd.gov/videoondemand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">rockvillemd.gov/videoondemand</a>. Community members are also welcome to watch meetings live in the Mayor and Council chambers at Rockville City Hall. If you require a reasonable accommodation, please complete the\u00a0<a href=\"https://www.rockvillemd.gov/request-a-reasonable-accommodation/\">Reasonable Accommodation Request Form</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"color: white; height: 0;\">.</p>",
