      "all_day": false,
      "description": "<p>Celebrate an evening of elegance and fun with wine and light refreshments. Wear a festive mask or your favorite costume, enjoy fellowship with friends, learn a new mocktail, and decorate a mask. Sponsored by Sunrise of Rockville.</p>\n<p>Transportation is available for City of Rockville residents.</p>\n<p>Space is still available. Register online, in person, or over the phone. Course #41211; $7/$10.</p>",
